    <bpmn:process id="W_W5057" name="W5057. Propane/LPG Cylinder Exchange &amp; Refill Program Strategy &amp; Business-Model Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy refresh (VS-33); category strategy for Seasonal/Outdoor, Plumbing, Material Handling; new program
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: 1 program across 200 stores + bulk accounts
Owner: Category Manager (Seasonal/Outdoor/Plumbing) / Director Store Services
Participants: Strategy (VS-33), Merchandising (VS-01), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), HSE (VS-24), Legal/Compliance (VS-100/VS-22), Supplier Mgmt (VS-03)
Source: workflow W5057 — Propane/LPG Cylinder Exchange &amp; Refill Program Strategy &amp; Business-Model Design</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5057_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5057_Lane1" name="Category Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5057_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5057_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5057_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5057_Lane2" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5057_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5057_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5057_Start4" name="Strategy refresh (VS-33); category strategy for Seasonal/Outdoor, Plumbing, Material…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5057_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5057_Task5" name="Set the LPG program strategy &amp; model: exchange (full-for-empty pool) vs refill…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the LPG program strategy &amp; model: exchange (full-for-empty pool) vs refill (customer-owned) vs both, the cylinder-size portfolio (11kg/5kg/50kg/forklift), the attach-to-appliance-sale linkage (grill/heater/torch), and the recurring-revenue/deposit-float economics
Responsible (R): Category Mgr / Director Store Services
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / Category Director
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5057_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5057_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5057_Task6" name="Build the safety &amp; regulatory posture: confirm BFP Fire Code storage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build the safety &amp; regulatory posture: confirm BFP Fire Code storage feasibility per store, DOE retailer-accreditation scope (W5063), and the HAZMAT/OSH operating model with HSE/Legal (links VS-24/VS-114/VS-100)
Responsible (R): HSE / Legal / Category Mgr
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / HSE Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5057_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5057_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5057_Task7" name="Govern &amp; approve: leadership/HSE sign-off (VS-36), the entity/scope (Depot…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern &amp; approve: leadership/HSE sign-off (VS-36), the entity/scope (Depot Inc.), and the KPIs (exchange volume, attach rate, deposit-float, safety/incident rate, margin) with FP&amp;A
Responsible (R): Category Mgr / FP&amp;A / HSE
Accountable (A): Director Store Services / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5057_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5057_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5057_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5057_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-755 (ensure controlled execution — LPG Program Strategy, Bulk Supply, Cylinder Fleet &amp; Regulatory Setup (PA-175.1).) | - CTL-755: program HSE/leadership-approved (VS-36/VS-24); BFP feasibility per store; economics FP&amp;A-validated
Owner: Category Manager (Seasonal/Outdoor/Plumbing) / Director Store Services</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5057_Assoc10" sourceRef="W5057_Annotation9" targetRef="W5057_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
