    <bpmn:process id="W_W5058" name="W5058. LPG Bulk Supply, Vendor Selection, Pricing &amp; Procurement Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program setup (W5057); vendor contract renewal; supply/price review
Frequency: Annual contract + ongoing supply
Volume: ~1–3 bulk LPG suppliers; bulk + refill-service vendors
Owner: Supplier/Buyer (VS-03) / Category Manager
Participants: Supplier Mgmt (VS-03), Procurement (VS-34), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Legal (VS-100), Logistics (VS-06)
Source: workflow W5058 — LPG Bulk Supply, Vendor Selection, Pricing &amp; Procurement Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5058_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5058_Lane1" name="Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5058_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5058_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5058_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5058_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5058_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5058_Start3" name="Program setup (W5057); vendor contract renewal; supply/price review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5058_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5058_Task4" name="Select bulk LPG supplier(s): qualify DOE-licensed LPG marketers/refiners…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Select bulk LPG supplier(s): qualify DOE-licensed LPG marketers/refiners, evaluate pricing (indexed vs fixed), supply reliability, cylinder-compatibility (RA 11592 — W5059), and HSE/safety record (VS-161/VS-131)
Responsible (R): Buyer / Supplier Mgmt / Legal
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / Director Store Services
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5058_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5058_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5058_Task5" name="Negotiate &amp; contract: bulk supply agreement, refill/re-valve/hydrostatic-test…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Negotiate &amp; contract: bulk supply agreement, refill/re-valve/hydrostatic-test service terms, delivery logistics (bulk tanker vs cylinder replenishment — W5070), and price-escalation/FX clauses
Responsible (R): Buyer / Legal / Logistics
Accountable (A): Category Mgr
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5058_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5058_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5058_Task6" name="Manage ongoing supply &amp; cost: monitor LPG spot/index cost (links VS-106…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage ongoing supply &amp; cost: monitor LPG spot/index cost (links VS-106 commodity), pass-through to retail price (W5062), supplier scorecard (VS-67), and replenishment to stores (W5070)
Responsible (R): Buyer / FP&amp;A / Logistics
Accountable (A): Category Mgr
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5058_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5058_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5058_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5058_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-755 (ensure controlled execution — LPG Program Strategy, Bulk Supply, Cylinder Fleet &amp; Regulatory Setup (PA-175.1).) | - CTL-755: supplier DOE-licensed &amp; HSE-vetted (VS-161/VS-131); contract Legal-reviewed (VS-100); cost reconciled (VS-158)
Owner: Supplier/Buyer (VS-03) / Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5058_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5058_Annotation8" targetRef="W5058_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
