    <bpmn:process id="W_W5059" name="W5059. LPG Cylinder-Fleet Strategy, Standardization, Branding &amp; RA 11592 Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program setup (W5057); cylinder fleet refresh; regulatory change
Frequency: Annual strategy + ongoing
Volume: ~10,000s of cylinders in the pool at maturity
Owner: Category Manager / Legal-Regulatory (VS-100/VS-22)
Participants: Legal/Compliance (VS-100/VS-22), Supplier Mgmt (VS-03), HSE (VS-24), Logistics (VS-06)
Source: workflow W5059 — LPG Cylinder-Fleet Strategy, Standardization, Branding &amp; RA 11592 Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5059_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5059_Lane1" name="Category Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5059_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5059_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5059_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5059_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5059_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5059_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5059_Start4" name="Program setup (W5057); cylinder fleet refresh; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5059_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5059_Task5" name="Define cylinder-fleet strategy &amp; standardization: the cylinder sizes/valves (RA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define cylinder-fleet strategy &amp; standardization: the cylinder sizes/valves (RA 11592 standardized cylinder specification), branding/ownership model (BuildRight-branded pool vs supplier-owned), and interchange rules under RA 11592 (LPG Industry Regulation Act)
Responsible (R): Category Mgr / Legal / Supplier Mgmt
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / Director Store Services
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5059_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5059_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5059_Task6" name="Ensure RA 11592 &amp; DTI-BPS compliance: cylinder specification/standard (DTI-BPS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ensure RA 11592 &amp; DTI-BPS compliance: cylinder specification/standard (DTI-BPS PS/ICC — links VS-117), serialized identification, valve/overfill/safety device spec, and the refill/re-qual obligation
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / Supplier Mgmt
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5059_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5059_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5059_Task7" name="Set the deposit/ownership &amp; interchange policy: deposit value by cylinder size…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Set the deposit/ownership &amp; interchange policy: deposit value by cylinder size, interchange rules (accepting competitor cylinders per RA 11592 where applicable), and the asset-tracking model (W5060)
Responsible (R): Category Mgr / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / Director Store Services
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5059_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5059_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5059_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5059_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-100 (ensure LPG cylinder safety &amp; deposit accounting.) | - CTL-755: cylinders DTI-BPS PS/ICC-certified (VS-117); RA 11592 interchange policy Legal-defined; deposits enforced
Owner: Category Manager / Legal-Regulatory (VS-100/VS-22)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
