    <bpmn:process id="W_W5060" name="W5060. Cylinder Procurement, Ownership/Pool Model, Asset Tracking &amp; Lifecycle Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Fleet plan (W5059); replenishment; cylinder condemnation
Frequency: Per procurement batch + ongoing lifecycle
Volume: ~10,000s pool cylinders across 200 stores
Owner: Logistics/Fixed-Asset (VS-06/VS-35) / Category Manager
Participants: Procurement (VS-34), Finance/Fixed-Asset (VS-35), Logistics (VS-06), Store Ops (VS-07), Supplier (VS-03)
Source: workflow W5060 — Cylinder Procurement, Ownership/Pool Model, Asset Tracking &amp; Lifecycle Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5060_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5060_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5060_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5060_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5060_Lane2" name="Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5060_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5060_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5060_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5060_Start4" name="Fleet plan (W5059); replenishment; cylinder condemnation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5060_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5060_Task5" name="Procure &amp; take on cylinder pool: order standardized cylinders (W5059)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procure &amp; take on cylinder pool: order standardized cylinders (W5059), asset-tag (serialized barcode/RFID — VS-151), capitalise or treat as supplier-consigned pool per ownership model, and reconcile to deposit float
Responsible (R): Procurement / Finance / Logistics
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / Finance Mgr
Duration: Per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5060_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5060_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5060_Task6" name="Track the pool across the network: per-cylinder location/status…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Track the pool across the network: per-cylinder location/status (full/empty/in-transit/condemned), deposit linkage, and store/DC inventory (links VS-111 RTI pattern, VS-05 inventory)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Store Ops / IT
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5060_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5060_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5060_Task7" name="Manage lifecycle: re-qual/hydrostatic-test schedule, re-valve, condemnation of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage lifecycle: re-qual/hydrostatic-test schedule, re-valve, condemnation of unsafe/expired cylinders (W5069), and disposal/recycling (links VS-73) per RA 11592
Responsible (R): Logistics / HSE / Supplier
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5060_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5060_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5060_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
