        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-100 (ensure LPG cylinder safety &amp; deposit accounting.) | - CTL-755: cylinders serialized &amp; tracked; deposit enforced; expired cylinders condemned (W5069); disposal per VS-73/RA 11592
Owner: Logistics/Fixed-Asset (VS-06/VS-35) / Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
