      <bpmn:userTask id="W5061_Task5" name="Design the LPG cage/yard: outdoor/ventilated cage location (away from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the LPG cage/yard: outdoor/ventilated cage location (away from ignition/egress/customer flow), capacity (max cylinders per BFP/DOE), fire-rated construction, ventilation, signage, and segregation from other DG (links VS-114/VS-147)
Responsible (R): Facilities / HSE / Fire consultant
Accountable (A): HSE Manager / VP Store Operations
Duration: Per store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5061_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5061_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5061_Task6" name="Install fire/safety infrastructure: detection/gas-leak alarm, fire…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Install fire/safety infrastructure: detection/gas-leak alarm, fire extinguisher/suppression suited to gas, bonding/grounding, spill containment, lighting, and CCTV coverage (VS-23)
Responsible (R): Facilities / HSE / Security
Accountable (A): HSE Manager
Duration: Per store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5061_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5061_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5061_Task7" name="Commission &amp; certify: BFP Fire Safety Inspection/FSIC (links VS-166), LGU/DOE…">
