Responsible (R): HSE / Facilities / Legal
Accountable (A): HSE Manager / VP Store Operations
Duration: Per store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5061_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
