      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cost change (W5058); pricing review; competitor change
Frequency: At launch + periodic (monthly/trigger-based)
Volume: ~3–4 cylinder sizes × exchange + refill tariffs
Owner: Pricing (VS-01.2) / Category Manager
Participants: Pricing (VS-01.2), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Category Mgr, Marketing (VS-14), Compliance (price-integrity VS-118)
Source: workflow W5062 — LPG Retail Pricing, Exchange Fee, Refill Tariff &amp; Margin Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
