      <bpmn:userTask id="W5062_Task4" name="Set the exchange &amp; refill pricing: exchange fee (full-for-empty), refill tariff…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the exchange &amp; refill pricing: exchange fee (full-for-empty), refill tariff (per kg for customer-owned), deposit value (W5059), and the cost pass-through from bulk LPG cost (W5058/VS-106)
Responsible (R): Pricing / Category Mgr / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / Pricing Director
Duration: At launch + monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5062_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5062_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5062_Task5" name="Ensure price integrity &amp; disclosure: all-in price disclosure (RA 7394)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ensure price integrity &amp; disclosure: all-in price disclosure (RA 7394), price-tag/shelf-edge (VS-151), and the deposit-refund transparency (links VS-118)
Responsible (R): Pricing / Compliance
Accountable (A): Category Mgr
Duration: At launch + review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5062_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5062_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5062_Task6" name="Link promotions &amp; analytics: tie to grill/heater/torch appliance promotions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Link promotions &amp; analytics: tie to grill/heater/torch appliance promotions (VS-14/VS-58), competitive monitoring (VS-57), and feed margin analytics (W5077)
Responsible (R): Pricing / Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): Category Mgr
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5062_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
